{"4360980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ocean", "steam_appid": 4360980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ocean, an AI-powered collectible card game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean, you will create your own AI companions. Every interaction and adventure you have with them will deepen your shared memories and forge a unique and special relationship between you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/d19da6688cff92da509652905e6cc630.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1344 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own AI cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try creating your own unique cards by entering their real names and using consciousness items. Each card will have a unique appearance. Unleash your imagination—you might even get some unexpected surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/581a5490ebe4325c1e59f1802be67b4f.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An adventure and battle from scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure with your creations across the seven realms, overcoming countless difficulties to find the root cause and uncover the truth of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/008e57e19868b23a9352434f705c95a3.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse AI Companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean, NPCs and monsters are more than just background characters. By introducing AI technology, NPCs and monsters are given life and can be recruited into your party in various ways. You can also develop a bond with them, and for your favorite characters, you can even bring them to life by calling them by their real names!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/85a492636cb7a110f7885515b95c95f2.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Ocean, an AI-powered collectible card game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean, you will create your own AI companions. Every interaction and adventure you have with them will deepen your shared memories and forge a unique and special relationship between you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/d19da6688cff92da509652905e6cc630.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1344 height=768 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Create your own AI cards!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try creating your own unique cards by entering their real names and using consciousness items. Each card will have a unique appearance. Unleash your imagination—you might even get some unexpected surprises!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/581a5490ebe4325c1e59f1802be67b4f.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An adventure and battle from scratch</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adventure with your creations across the seven realms, overcoming countless difficulties to find the root cause and uncover the truth of this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/008e57e19868b23a9352434f705c95a3.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Diverse AI Companions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Ocean, NPCs and monsters are more than just background characters. By introducing AI technology, NPCs and monsters are given life and can be recruited into your party in various ways. You can also develop a bond with them, and for your favorite characters, you can even bring them to life by calling them by their real names!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/extras/85a492636cb7a110f7885515b95c95f2.avif?t=1774411657\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Welcome to Ocean, the world's first AI-powered collectible card game! Here, you'll create your own unique AI cards. Every interaction and adventure will forge a special, one-of-a-kind relationship between you. All cards are freely tradable; build your own card world!", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/ce3c818856a18f9a4e23285907c71806dbabdac1/header.jpg?t=1774411657", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/77eb82f2a77cf47262aa35b92c65a5e1aa8b6840/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774411657", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4360980/77eb82f2a77cf47262aa35b92c65a5e1aa8b6840/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774411657", "website": "https://ocean-h5.doinggame.com/?v=new", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows® 7 SP1 / 8.1 / 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen™3 1200 / Inte